n close. The address-book transition also clears the flag before opening its tab. The original patch set the flag before awaiting the view and was backed out; that ordering is not the accepted current contract. This evidence covers the named command controller and modal transitions, not every shortcut implementation.","title":"Account Hub command blocking follows the modal lifecycle","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
